          A ruggedized electronic climate control module engineered for commercial passenger buses. Features automated multi-zone temperature sensing, compressor clutch modulation, variable blower PWM control, and SAE J1939 CAN communication with the vehicle dashboard.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-3 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-brand-dark rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-brand-border/60">
